-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party assets

Bivouac bundles NO third-party assets — it ships only the TypeScript/JavaScript,
CSS, and language files written for this module. It contains no fonts, images,
icons, or textures, and does not redistribute any Foundry VTT core assets. All
bundled files are therefore covered by the MIT license above.

Two things are fetched from the network at runtime, at the user's request, and
are never redistributed as part of this module:

  * Google Fonts — if you name a Google Font on a Note tile or the Cast Bar,
    Bivouac loads that font's stylesheet from fonts.googleapis.com on demand.
    Each font remains under its own license, granted by Google Fonts.
  * Web view tiles — a Web view tile embeds whatever page URL you give it. That
    content belongs to whoever published it and is subject to their terms.

Should any third-party asset be bundled in future, it will be listed here with
its own license, which would govern that asset instead of the MIT license.
